eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667260/extras/900b5f98047e9660da72744def54eb4a.webm?t=1710871096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667260/extras/900b5f98047e9660da72744def54eb4a.mp4?t=1710871096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>-Deckbuilding Mastery: Craft and refine your deck of cards, each representing a unique spell or tower, to develop a winning strategy.<br></li><li>-Epic Adventures: Explore the lush and immersive Forest Kingdom, each map presenting a new tactical puzzle.<br></li><li>-Tower Defense Challenges: Defend your kingdom against hordes of cunning foes in thrilling tower defense battles.<br></li><li>-Roguelike Progression: Embrace the roguelike elements as you face perils, earn rewards, and grow stronger with each playthrough.<br></li><li>-Strategic Choices: Adapt your deck, manage resources, and make critical decisions to survive the evolving challenges.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667260/extras/a8ec0e81a4269ca0eebf4b9e87531ebb.poster.avif?t=1710871096\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667260/extras/a8ec0e81a4269ca0eebf4b9e87531ebb.webm?t=1710871096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667260/extras/a8ec0e81a4269ca0eebf4b9e87531ebb.mp4?t=1710871096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore and conquer the untamed landscapes of the Forest Kingdom. Chart uncharted territories, unveil secrets, and establish your dominion in 'King Wizard of the Forest Kingdom.",
